<section class="policy-page">
  <div class="container policy-page__container">
    {% case section.settings.policy_key %}
      {% when 'contact' %}
        <div class="policy-page__eyebrow">Oregon Badminton Academy Pro Shop</div>
        <h1>Contact Us</h1>
        <p class="policy-page__intro">We’re here to help with your order, product questions, and pro-shop services.</p>
        <div class="policy-page__grid">
          <div class="policy-page__card"><h2>Visit the Pro Shop</h2><p>11150 SW Allen Blvd<br>Beaverton, OR 97005</p></div>
          <div class="policy-page__card"><h2>Get in touch</h2><p><a href="tel:+15034307861">(503) 430-7861</a><br><a href="mailto:info@orbadminton.com">info@orbadminton.com</a></p></div>
        </div>
      {% when 'shipment' %}
        <div class="policy-page__eyebrow">Delivery & pickup</div><h1>Shipment & Pickup</h1>
        <p class="policy-page__intro">Shipping and pickup information for orders placed through the OBA Pro Shop.</p>
        <div class="policy-page__content">
          <h2>Shipping</h2><p>Orders are generally dispatched within 2 days after payment is received. Available delivery options may include tracking and drop-off without signature. If you require a UPS service with a signature, additional charges may apply; please contact us before selecting that service.</p>
          <p>A tracking link will be provided for shipped orders. Shipping charges include handling, packing, and postage; transportation costs vary according to total shipment weight. Separate orders cannot be combined, so each order may incur its own shipping charges.</p>
          <h2>In-store pickup</h2><p>Pickup at Oregon Badminton Academy is free. Please call ahead of time before coming to collect your order.</p>
          <h2>Free shipping</h2><p>For orders shipping within the USA, free shipping applies automatically when the cart total is $125 or more, subject to the store’s offer terms. OBA reserves the right to revise this offer.</p>
        </div>
      {% when 'returns' %}
        <div class="policy-page__eyebrow">Returns & exchanges</div><h1>Return Policy</h1>
        <p class="policy-page__intro">Please review these requirements before sending an order back.</p>
        <div class="policy-page__content">
          <h2>Online orders</h2><p>For an online-order return, contact us within 24 hours of receiving the product. You may contact the pro shop at <a href="tel:+15034307861">(503) 430-7861</a> or <a href="mailto:OBA3ZH@gmail.com">OBA3ZH@gmail.com</a>.</p>
          <p>Unused products may be returned within 14 days of delivery for a refund of the order amount less shipping charges. Exchanges are also available within 14 days of shipment.</p>
          <h2>Conditions & exceptions</h2><ul><li>Used items that cannot be resold as new are not eligible for return.</li><li>Special-order items are not eligible for return or exchange.</li><li>Products must be returned complete, including all manufacturer parts and product manuals.</li><li>Close-out, sale, and special-order products are final sale and are not refundable or exchangeable.</li><li>Return shipping is the customer’s responsibility and the return must include tracking information provided to OBA.</li><li>A 10% restocking fee applies to returned items.</li></ul>
          <p>If you are unsure whether an item qualifies for return, please contact OBA before the 14-day return deadline.</p>
        </div>
      {% when 'terms' %}
        <div class="policy-page__eyebrow">Store policies</div><h1>Terms & Conditions</h1>
        <p class="policy-page__intro">These terms summarize the online shopping policies published by Oregon Badminton Academy Pro Shop.</p>
        <div class="policy-page__content">
          <h2>Using the site</h2><p>By using the OregonBadminton.com online store, you agree to follow the store’s policies and use the site for lawful shopping and communication.</p>
          <h2>Orders, products & pricing</h2><p>Products are offered subject to availability and may be limited in quantity. Product information, pricing, promotions, and offers may be changed or corrected when necessary. If an item is listed with an incorrect price or other incorrect information, OBA may contact you for instructions or cancel the affected order and notify you.</p>
          <h2>Promotions & shipping offers</h2><p>Promotional offers may have their own restrictions and exclusions and may be modified or ended without notice. The published free-shipping offer is limited to economy shipping within the contiguous 48 United States, requires the entire order to ship to one address, excludes drop shipments and oversize items, and cannot be combined with another offer or applied to prior purchases.</p>
          <h2>Customer information & communications</h2><p>Information supplied during shopping, account creation, returns, exchanges, customer-service requests, and other site interactions is handled according to the store’s privacy practices. OBA may use service providers for functions such as shipping, address verification, payment processing, and fraud protection.</p>
          <h2>Questions</h2><p>For questions about an order or these policies, contact the pro shop at <a href="tel:+15034307861">(503) 430-7861</a> or <a href="mailto:info@orbadminton.com">info@orbadminton.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
      {% when 'privacy' %}
        <div class="policy-page__eyebrow">Your information</div><h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="policy-page__intro">This policy explains the types of information OBA says it collects, why it is collected, and how it may be used or shared.</p>
        <div class="policy-page__content">
          <h2>Information we collect</h2><p>Depending on how you interact with the store, information may include your name, billing and delivery address, email address, telephone or mobile number, payment-card information, purchase/return/exchange information, and information about how you use the site.</p>
          <h2>When information is collected</h2><p>Information may be collected when you purchase or request products or services, receive a gift package or certificate, create an account, contact OBA, interact with social media or site features, subscribe to emails or notifications, participate in promotions or contests, visit the showroom, submit reviews or suggestions, or use the site from a computer, tablet, or mobile device.</p>
          <h2>Cookies & similar technologies</h2><p>Cookies, tracking pixels, web beacons, and related technologies may be used to remember cart contents, recognize returning customers, speed up checkout for account holders, understand site navigation and searches, personalize marketing, and measure the effectiveness of emails and marketing efforts.</p><p>Technical information may include your operating system, browser type, IP address, internet service provider, and date, time, and clickstream information.</p>
          <h2>How information is used</h2><p>OBA states that information may be used to process and track orders, provide requested services, communicate about order status, send promotional communications, understand product preferences, customize communications, provide information about purchased products, and improve merchandise selection and customer service.</p>
          <h2>Sharing & privacy choices</h2><p>OBA states that it does not share customer email addresses with other companies. Service providers may receive information needed to provide shipping, address verification, payment processing, fraud protection, or similar services. Information may also be disclosed when required by law or in connection with a transfer of business assets.</p><p>You can manage cookies through your browser. Disabling cookies may limit some personalized or shopping features. To update customer information, log in to your account or contact OBA; identity verification may be required.</p>
          <h2>Contact</h2><p>For privacy questions or requests, contact OBA at <a href="tel:+15034307861">(503) 430-7861</a> or <a href="mailto:info@orbadminton.com">info@orbadminton.com</a>.</p>
        </div>
    {% endcase %}
  </div>
</section>

<style>
.policy-page{padding:clamp(56px,8vw,110px) 0}.policy-page__container{max-width:980px}.policy-page__eyebrow{font-size:11px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--oba-muted)}.policy-page h1{font-size:clamp(48px,8vw,96px);line-height:.88;letter-spacing:-.065em;margin:12px 0 24px}.policy-page__intro{max-width:680px;font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--oba-muted);margin:0 0 46px}.policy-page__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:18px}.policy-page__card{padding:28px;border:1px solid var(--oba-m3-outline);border-radius:var(--oba-m3-xl);background:var(--oba-m3-surface-high);box-shadow:var(--oba-m3-shadow-1)}.policy-page__card h2,.policy-page__content h2{font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);line-height:1.05;letter-spacing:-.03em;margin:0 0 14px}.policy-page__card p,.policy-page__content p,.policy-page__content li{font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;color:var(--oba-muted)}.policy-page__card p{margin:0}.policy-page__card a,.policy-page__content a{color:var(--oba-ink);text-decoration:underline;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}.policy-page__content{max-width:780px}.policy-page__content h2{margin-top:42px}.policy-page__content h2:first-child{margin-top:0}.policy-page__content p{margin:0 0 18px}.policy-page__content ul{padding-left:22px;margin:0 0 22px}.policy-page__content li{margin:0 0 8px}@media(max-width:700px){.policy-page{padding:46px 0 70px}.policy-page__intro{font-size:16px;margin-bottom:34px}.policy-page__grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.policy-page__card{padding:22px;border-radius:var(--oba-m3-lg)}}
</style>

{% schema %}
{"name":"Policy page","settings":[{"type":"select","id":"policy_key","label":"Page","options":[{"value":"contact","label":"Contact Us"},{"value":"shipment","label":"Shipment & Pickup"},{"value":"returns","label":"Return Policy"},{"value":"terms","label":"Terms & Conditions"},{"value":"privacy","label":"Privacy Policy"}],"default":"contact"}]}
{% endschema %}
